bor"]]]]]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"},["DIV",{"class":"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8"},["DIV",{"class":"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center divide-y lg:divide-y-0 lg:divide-x divide-slate-100"},["DIV",{"class":"p-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#104F57]"},"1,450+"],["DIV",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium mt-1"},"Families Supported Since Inception"]],["DIV",{"class":"p-2 pt-6 lg:pt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#633C69]"},"$480,000+"],["DIV",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium mt-1"},"Direct Emergency & Housing Aid Distributed"]],["DIV",{"class":"p-2 pt-6 lg:pt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#D67C35]"},"92%"],["DIV",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium mt-1"},"Workforce Graduate Job Placement Rate"]],["DIV",{"class":"p-2 pt-6 lg:pt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-700"},"18 Agents"],["DIV",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium mt-1"},"Human-Supervised AI Operations Layer"]]]]],["SECTION",{"id":"founder-section","class":"space-y-16 py-12 border-t border-slate-200/80 bg-white"},["DIV",{"class":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-14"},["DIV",{"class":"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3"},["DIV",{"class":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#104F57] bg-[#E8F3F1] px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-teal-200"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#D67C35]","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"}],["path",{"d":"M20 2v4"}],["path",{"d":"M22 4h-4"}],["circle",{"cx":"4","cy":"20","r":"2"}]],["SPAN",{},"ORGANIZATIONAL FOUNDER & AUTHENTIC HERITAGE"]],["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#104F57]"},"Comfort Dondo — Founder of Phumulani"],["P",{"class":"text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed"},"Survivor, community builder, author, and public policy advocate dedicated to ensuring that no African immigrant or refugee woman walks the path of healing alone."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center"},["DIV",{"class":"lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center"},["DIV",{"class":"relative group max-w-sm sm:max-w-md w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"absolute -inset-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#104F57] via-[#633C69] to-[#D67C35] rounded-3xl blur-lg opacity-25 group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-500"}],["DIV",{"class":"relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-2 border-slate-200/90 bg-white"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://localhost:3000/images/leadership/comfort-dondo.svg","alt":"Comfort Dondo, Founder and Executive Director of Phumulani","class":"w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/5] transform hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300","loading":"lazy","referrerpolicy":"no-referrer","src":"/images/leadership/comfort-dondo.svg"}],["DIV",{"class":"p-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 text-center"},["DIV",{"class":"font-serif font-bold text-base text-slate-900"},"Comfort Dondo"],["DIV",{"class":"text-xs text-[#104F57] font-semibold mt-0.5"},"Founder & Executive Director · Phumulani"],["DIV",{"class":"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1"},"Zimbabwean-born · Minneapolis, MN · Est. 2017"]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"lg:col-span-7 space-y-6"},["DIV",{"class":"bg-[#E8F3F1]/50 border-l-4 border-[#104F57] p-4 rounded-r-xl"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-quote w-6 h-6 text-[#104F57] mb-2 opacity-50","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"}],["path",{"d":"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"}]],["P",{"class":"font-serif text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-800 italic leading-relaxed"},"\"In Zulu, ",["EM",{},"Phumulani"]," means 'to rest' or 'peace'. When I fled violence as an immigrant mother in Minnesota, I realized that surviving is not enough. Survivors need a place of true spiritual rest, familiar meals, cultural sisterhood, and real economic keys to rebuild their lives.\""],["DIV",{"class":"text-xs font-bold text-[#104F57] mt-2 tracking-wide"},"— Comfort Dondo, Founder"]],["DIV",{"class":"space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed"},["P",{},"Comfort Dondo arrived in the United States from Zimbabwe at age 17. After experiencing childhood trauma and domestic violence, she turned to mainstream shelter systems—only to find profound cultural and linguistic gaps. Traditional crisis facilities often lacked familiar foods, cultural understanding of immigration dependencies, or trauma support that honored the sacred traditions of African women."],["P",{},"In 2017, Comfort established ",["STRONG",{},"Phumulani: Minnesota African Women Against Violence"]," as a grassroots 501(c)(3) nonprofit in Brooklyn Park. Under her guidance, Phumulani pioneered culturally specific ",["EM",{},"Healing Homes"],", weekly ",["EM",{},"Tea Healing Circles"],", Order for Protection court accompaniment, and the ",["EM",{},"Immigrant Women Entrepreneurship Lab"],"."],["P",{},"Today, Phumulani has walked beside over ",["STRONG",{},"1,450 survivors and families"]," across Hennepin, Ramsey, and surrounding Minnesota counties, distributing more than $480,000 in emergency rental aid and lease bridge funding."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-center"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-[#104F57] mx-auto mb-1","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}]],["DIV",{"class":"font-bold text-xs text-slate-900"},"Rest & Refuge"],["DIV",{"class":"text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5"},"Culturally safe shelter"]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-center"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-heart w-5 h-5 text-[#633C69] mx-auto mb-1","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"}]],["DIV",{"class":"font-bold text-xs text-slate-900"},"Sisterhood"],["DIV",{"class":"text-[10px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5"},"Tea Healing Circles"]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-center"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-award w-5 h-5 text-[#D67C35] mx-auto mb-1","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"m15.477 12.89 1.51