-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}],["path",{"d":"m9 12 2 2 4-4"}]],["SPAN",{},"Zero-Disclosure Survivor Firewall"]],["P",{"class":"leading-relaxed text-slate-600"},"Pursuant to Violence Against Women Act (VAWA) 34 U.S.C. § 12291(b)(2), Phumulani never discloses personally identifying information (PII) of survivors without written, informed, and time-limited consent. Survivor records are strictly segregated from general operational databases."]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-lock w-4 h-4 text-teal-600","aria-hidden":"true"},["rect",{"width":"18","height":"11","x":"3","y":"11","rx":"2","ry":"2"}],["path",{"d":"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"}]],["SPAN",{},"Donor Bill of Rights & Privacy"]],["P",{"class":"leading-relaxed text-slate-600"},"Phumulani adheres to the Association of Fundraising Professionals (AFP) Donor Bill of Rights. We never sell, rent, trade, or share donor contact information or giving records with external commercial marketing entities."]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-globe w-4 h-4 text-blue-600","aria-hidden":"true"},["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["path",{"d":"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"}],["path",{"d":"M2 12h20"}]],["SPAN",{},"Zero Commercial Ad Tracking"]],["P",{"class":"leading-relaxed text-slate-600"},"Our website contains zero third-party advertising trackers, Facebook Meta pixels, or Google Ads remarketing cookies. Digital interactions remain private and safe from surveillance or behavioral profiling."]]]],["SECTION",{"id":"accessibility-section","class":"bg-slate-900 text-white py-16"},["DIV",{"class":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8"},["DIV",{"class":"border-b border-slate-800 pb-4"},["DIV",{"class":"text-xs font-bold text-teal-300 uppercase tracking-wider"},"Universal Design"],["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-white"},"Accessibility Statement & WCAG 2.2 AA Conformance"],["P",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1"},"Phumulani is committed to ensuring full digital inclusion and dignified usability for people with all physical, sensory, and cognitive abilities."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-xs"},["DIV",{"class":"bg-slate-800/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 space-y-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-bold text-teal-300"},"Keyboard Navigation"],["P",{"class":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"},"Full Tab, Shift+Tab, and Enter keyboard focus traversal with visible high-contrast focus rings and zero keyboard traps."]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-slate-800/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 space-y-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-bold text-teal-300"},"Screen Reader Support"],["P",{"class":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"},"Semantic HTML5 landmarks (header, nav, main, section, footer) and explicit ARIA labels for non-text SVGs and modal dialogues."]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-slate-800/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 space-y-2"},["DIV",{"class":"font-bold text-teal-300"},"Contrast & Scalability"],["P",{"class":"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"},"Color contrast ratios meet or exceed 4.5:1 for body copy and 7:1 for headings. Text can be e