"id":"news-section","class":"bg-slate-50 py-16 border-y border-slate-200"},["DIV",{"class":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-end gap-4"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"text-xs font-bold text-[#104F57] uppercase tracking-wider"},"Publications & Press"],["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900"},"Latest News & Authored Works"],["P",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1"},"Stories of resilience, executive reports, and published books by Founder Comfort Dondo."]],["DIV",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-500"},"Verified IRS 501(c)(3) Public Disclosures"]],["DIV",{"class":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"},["DIV",{"class":"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4"},["DIV",{"class":"space-y-3"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-bold text-[#633C69] bg-purple-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded"},"Published Memoir"],["SPAN",{},"2021 Release"]],["H3",{"class":"font-serif text-xl font-bold text-slate-900"},"Facing the Giants"],["P",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"},"Comfort Dondo's acclaimed memoir chronicling her lived journey through adversity, displacement, and the unyielding determination to build culturally grounded sanctuaries for immigrant women."]],["DIV",{"class":"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-bold text-slate-700"},"Author: Comfort Dondo"],["SPAN",{"class":"text-[#104F57] font-semibold"},"Available via Community Library"]]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4"},["DIV",{"class":"space-y-3"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-bold text-teal-800 bg-teal-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded"},"Co-Authored Anthology"],["SPAN",{},"Global Women's Leadership"]],["H3",{"class":"font-serif text-xl font-bold text-slate-900"},"Sacred Promise"],["P",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"},"An inspiring collaborative volume with Dr. Tererai Trent and visionary global leaders exploring the sacred covenants women make to lift each other out of oppression and into economic dignity."]],["DIV",{"class":"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-bold text-slate-700"},"Foreword: Dr. Tererai Trent"],["SPAN",{"class":"text-[#104F57] font-semibold"},"Minnesota Reading Circles"]]],["DIV",{"class":"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4"},["DIV",{"class":"space-y-3"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-bold text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded"},"Forthcoming Publication"],["SPAN",{},"2027 Preview"]],["H3",{"class":"font-serif text-xl font-bold text-slate-900"},"The Gift in Pain"],["P",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"},"A profound exploration of transforming deep psychological and systemic wounds into catalysts for revolutionary community organizing, social entrepreneurship, and generational liberation."]],["DIV",{"class":"pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-bold text-slate-700"},"Advance Announcements"],["SPAN",{"class":"text-amber-700 font-semibold"},"Excerpts in Tea Circles"]]]]]],["SECTION",{"id":"resources-section","class":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-8"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-end gap-4"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"text-xs font-bold text-[#104F57] uppercase tracking-wider"},"Self-Advocacy & Guidance"],["H2",{"class":"font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900"},"Community Resources & Downloadable Guides"],["P",{"class":"text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1"},"Trauma-inf